      "content": "THE VOID HAS COME\n\n\n[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45489705/158fba0b868e16807a7f17470a0e46bb62dcfcaf.png\"]\n\nA new secret level has appeared on Cursedland, will you be able to survive?\n\n\nNEW ACHIEVEMENTS\n\n\n[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45489705/9a782e78577aeb7a0001399d6710243ba80ff7ba.png\"]\n\nYou can unlock new achievemets for the new zones, and you have the Cursed-abecedary (you have to enter the Farlopa-castle to unllock it).\n\n\nLEVEL SELECTOR\n[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45489705/4b66cc9fd1e2ab6f9f643aad477d9af9e8df42e2.jpg\"]\n\nYou can now select a level to go to, in the Main Menu screen.\n\n\nTHE MOON\n\n\nThe moon level has been updated, now it is shorter than before."
